          "text": "&ldquo;Allah&rsquo;s Messenger (ﷺ) said, &ldquo;Adam and Moses argued with each other. Moses said to Adam. &lsquo;You are Adam whose mistake expelled you from Paradise.&rsquo; Adam said to him, &lsquo;You are Moses whom Allah selected as His Messenger and as the one to whom He spoke directly; yet you blame me for a thing which had already been written in my fate before my creation?&rsquo;&rdquo; Allah&rsquo;s Messenger (ﷺ) said twice, &ldquo;So, Adam overpowered Moses.&rdquo;&rdquo;",
